{"id":"vod_bf_3251","vodId":"3251","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"滨虎","name_cn":"滨虎","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-4/277a037827afb997776b1084c06ef708.jpg"},"summary":"“minimum”——小小的奇迹，是极少部分人类先天拥有的特殊能力。本作主人公奈斯（逢坂良太 配音）和紫（羽多野涉 配音）就是异能持有者，奈斯拥有“灵长类最快的一步”，紫则拥有“怪力”的能力。两人组成了一个侦探组合，将“No-where”咖啡店的一角作为事务所，接受各种委托。他们经历了诱拐女大学生、连续猎奇杀人、中小学生持枪打劫等各类棘手事件。奈斯和紫调查某起案件时，发现奈斯的挚友、警察官亚特（神谷浩史 配音）也正在追查，他们发现案件的被害人有一个共同点，那就是他们都是“minimum”持有者。危机四伏又险象横生的异能少年侦探故事，就这样开始！　　本动画改编自小玉有起的同名漫画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-19 00:46:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/binhu/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:45.432Z"}